<title>USA: PCX to trade Calpine options on July 2.</title>
<headline>PCX to trade Calpine options on July 2.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Exchange said Friday it would begin trading options on Calpine Corp on July 2.</p>
<p>The options will open with strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20 and initial expirations in August, September, October and January, the PCX said. Position limits have been set at 4,500 contracts.</p>
<p>The options have been allocated to lead market makers Steve Noonan, John Oppenheimer and Robert Weiss.</p>
<p>Calpine shares were up 1/16 at 17-15/16 Friday morning.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
